"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">12</div><h1>현재완료</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Das Perfekt</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 12의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 · 보강 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보조 동사는 두 번째, 과거분사는 문장 끝에 놓아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">규칙·불규칙·혼합 동사의 과거분사를 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">분리동사·비분리동사·-ieren 동사에서 ge-의 자리를 정해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">이동·상태 변화 동사와 bleiben·passieren에 sein을 골라요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"01c1943480\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gebracht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Meine Schwester hat uns Kuchen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(bringen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">내 여동생이 우리에게 케이크를 가져다줬어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Meine Schwester hat uns Kuchen <b>gebracht</b>.</div>bringen은 혼합 동사예요. 모음이 바뀌고(i → a) 어미는 -t예요 — gebracht.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"96c4a5683d\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bezahlt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Hast du die Rechnung schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(bezahlen)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">청구서를 벌써 결제했어요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hast du die Rechnung schon <b>bezahlt</b>?</div>be-는 비분리 접두어라서 ge-를 붙이지 않아요 — bezahlt.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"89f79c9e7c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gearbeitet&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Mein Opa hat vierzig Jahre in Hamburg <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(arbeiten)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 할아버지는 40년 동안 함부르크에서 일하셨어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein Opa hat vierzig Jahre in Hamburg <b>gearbeitet</b>.</div>어간이 -t로 끝나면 -et를 붙여요 — gearbeitet.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7faeaf552e\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;getrunken&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Ich habe heute Morgen keinen Kaffee <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(trinken)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 오늘 아침에 커피를 안 마셨어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe heute Morgen keinen Kaffee <b>getrunken</b>.</div>trinken은 불규칙 동사예요. i → u로 바뀌고 -en이 붙어요 — getrunken.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"dda555abe5\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ist&quot;],[&quot;gefahren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Lukas <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> letzte Woche nach Wien <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(fahren)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">루카스는 지난주에 빈에 갔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Lukas <b>ist</b> letzte Woche nach Wien <b>gefahren</b>.</div>목적어 없이 장소를 옮기는 fahren은 sein과 써요 — ist gefahren.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"cd7787bd12\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sind&quot;],[&quot;aufgewacht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Die Kinder <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> heute sehr früh <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(aufwachen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">아이들은 오늘 아주 일찍 잠에서 깼어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Kinder <b>sind</b> heute sehr früh <b>aufgewacht</b>.</div>aufwachen은 상태가 바뀌는 동사라서 sein이에요.<br>분리동사는 접두어와 동사 사이에 ge가 들어가요 — aufgewacht.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8b5193a16e\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;geöffnet&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Wer hat die Fenster <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(öffnen)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">누가 창문들을 열었어요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wer hat die Fenster <b>geöffnet</b>?</div>öffnen처럼 -ffn으로 끝나는 어간에는 -et를 붙여요 — geöffnet.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5c4113f041\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gefunden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Ich habe meinen Schlüssel nicht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(finden)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 열쇠를 못 찾았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe meinen Schlüssel nicht <b>gefunden</b>.</div>finden은 i → u로 바뀌는 불규칙 동사예요 — gefunden.<br>nicht는 과거분사 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"59f8dcfb67\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> reparieren(수리하다)의 과거분사는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) gerepariert</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) repariert</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) reparieren</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) gereparieren</button></div><div class=\"qe\">-ieren 동사는 ge-를 붙이지 않고 -t로 끝나요 — repariert.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"48e40609f0\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> verkaufen(팔다)의 과거분사는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) verkaufen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) verkauft</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) vergekauft</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) geverkauft</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ver-는 비분리라서 ge가 없어요.<br>kaufen은 규칙 동사라서 -t로 끝나요 — verkauft.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5f6a357167\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Wir <span class=\"qblank\"></span> am Wochenende zu Hause geblieben.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) seid</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) hat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) haben</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bleiben은 sein과 써요. wir → sind.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"efc4834bec\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ihr die Serie schon gesehen?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Seid</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Habt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Hat</button></div><div class=\"qe\">4격 목적어(die Serie)가 있는 sehen은 haben과 써요. ihr → habt.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5090fb4114\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> '아기는 금방 잠들었어요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Das Baby ist eingeschlafen schnell.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Das Baby hat schnell eingeschlafen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Das Baby ist schnell geeinschlafen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) Das Baby ist schnell eingeschlafen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">einschlafen은 상태 변화라서 sein이에요.<br>분리동사 → ein + ge + schlafen, 과거분사는 문장 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"3cf56d8e71\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe gestern meinen Onkel angerufen&quot;,&quot;Gestern habe ich meinen Onkel angerufen&quot;,&quot;Ich habe meinen Onkel gestern angerufen&quot;,&quot;Meinen Onkel habe ich gestern angerufen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 어제 삼촌께 전화했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">angerufen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Onkel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">meinen</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe gestern meinen Onkel angerufen.</b></div>보조 동사 habe가 두 번째 자리, 과거분사 angerufen이 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"708732d954\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Was hast du gestern gegessen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 어제 뭐 먹었어요?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">gegessen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hast</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Was</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">gestern</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Was hast du gestern gegessen?</b></div>의문사 + 보조 동사 + 주어, 과거분사 gegessen은 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1f46419529\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;habe&quot;],[&quot;vergessen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> meinen Pass <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(vergessen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 여권을 깜빡했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich <b>habe</b> meinen Pass <b>vergessen</b>.</div>vergessen은 비분리 + 불규칙이라서 과거분사가 원형과 똑같아요 — habe vergessen.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"566eb5d247\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> gestern meinem Lehrer begegnet.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) bin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) habe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) hat</button></div><div class=\"qe\">begegnen(우연히 만나다)은 3격과 쓰지만 보조 동사는 sein이에요. ich → bin.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0b524a6c2d\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Mein Vater <span class=\"qblank\"></span> mich gestern nach Hause gefahren.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) habe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) hat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) ist</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fahren에 4격 목적어(mich)가 있으면 '태워 주다'라는 뜻이고 haben과 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7789ce0dc6\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ferngesehen&quot;],[&quot;gelesen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> „Hast du gestern <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(fernsehen)</span>?“ – „Nein, ich habe ein Buch <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(lesen)</span>.“</div><div class=\"qko\">&quot;어제 TV 봤어요?&quot; – &quot;아니요, 책을 읽었어요.&quot;</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · „Hast du gestern <b>ferngesehen</b>?“ – „Nein, ich habe ein Buch <b>gelesen</b>.“</div>분리동사 fernsehen → fern + ge + sehen.<br>lesen은 모음이 그대로인 불규칙 동사예요 — gelesen.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"34a1421001\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hast&quot;],[&quot;kennengelernt&quot;,&quot;kennen gelernt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Wann <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> du deine Frau <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:16ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(kennenlernen)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 아내를 언제 처음 알게 됐어요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wann <b>hast</b> du deine Frau <b>kennengelernt</b>?</div>kennenlernen은 kennen이 접두어처럼 움직여서 ge가 그 뒤에 들어가요 — kennengelernt.<br>4격 목적어가 있어서 haben이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"3a23a862aa\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Ist&quot;],[&quot;passiert&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> dir etwas <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(passieren)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">너 무슨 일 있었어요? (다친 데 없어요?)</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ist</b> dir etwas <b>passiert</b>?</div>passieren은 sein과 쓰고, -ieren 동사라서 ge가 없어요.<br>'누구에게' 일어났는지는 3격(dir)으로 말해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9c48e7a7b9\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hat&quot;],[&quot;begonnen&quot;],[&quot;bin&quot;],[&quot;gekommen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Das Konzert <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> um acht Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(beginnen)</span> und ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> erst um neun Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(kommen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">콘서트는 8시에 시작했는데 나는 9시에야 왔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Konzert <b>hat</b> um acht Uhr <b>begonnen</b> und ich <b>bin</b> erst um neun Uhr <b>gekommen</b>.</div>beginnen은 haben과 쓰고, be-로 시작해서 ge가 없어요 — hat begonnen.<br>kommen은 이동이라서 sein — bin gekommen.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"300b083a8e\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie ist letzten Sommer allein nach Japan gereist&quot;,&quot;Letzten Sommer ist sie allein nach Japan gereist&quot;,&quot;Nach Japan ist sie letzten Sommer allein gereist&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 지난여름에 혼자 일본을 여행했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">gereist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Japan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">letzten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Sommer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">allein</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie ist letzten Sommer allein nach Japan gereist.</b></div>reisen은 이동이라서 sein이에요.<br>과거분사 gereist가 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ee45511066\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Habt ihr das Geschenk schon eingepackt&quot;,&quot;Habt ihr schon das Geschenk eingepackt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 그 선물 벌써 포장했어요?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ihr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Geschenk</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">eingepackt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">schon</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Habt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Habt ihr das Geschenk schon eingepackt?</b></div>einpacken은 분리동사라서 ein + ge + packt예요.<br>Ja/Nein 의문문이라서 보조 동사 Habt가 맨 앞이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"f4f0b35ce8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bin&quot;],[&quot;aufgestanden&quot;],[&quot;habe&quot;],[&quot;besucht&quot;],[&quot;sind&quot;],[&quot;gelaufen&quot;],[&quot;hat&quot;],[&quot;gekocht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> Am Samstag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> ich erst um zehn Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(aufstehen)</span>. Am Nachmittag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> ich Mina <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(besuchen)</span>. Wir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> zwei Stunden <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 6\"><span class=\"qh\">(laufen)</span> und am Abend <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 7\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> Mina für mich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 8\"><span class=\"qh\">(kochen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">토요일에 나는 10시에야 일어났어요. 오후에 미나를 찾아갔어요. 우리는 두 시간 동안 걸었고, 저녁에는 미나가 나를 위해 요리했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Am Samstag <b>bin</b> ich erst um zehn Uhr <b>aufgestanden</b>. Am Nachmittag <b>habe</b> ich Mina <b>besucht</b>. Wir <b>sind</b> zwei Stunden <b>gelaufen</b> und am Abend <b>hat</b> Mina für mich <b>gekocht</b>.</div>aufstehen(상태 변화)·laufen(이동)은 sein, besuchen·kochen은 haben이에요.<br>aufgestanden은 ge가 가운데, besucht는 ge가 없어요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7b2a8c131c\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Wir haben am Sonntag zu Hause geblieben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Der Baum ist schnell gewachsen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Ich habe ihn sofort erkannt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Sie hat in Köln Musik studiert.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bleiben은 장소를 옮기지 않아도 sein과 써요 — Wir sind … geblieben.<br>erkennen은 er- 비분리 + 혼합 동사라서 erkannt, wachsen은 상태 변화라서 sein이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5086c284d3\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> '나는 그녀의 차를 라이프치히까지 몰고 갔어요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Ich habe ihr Auto nach Leipzig gefahren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Ich habe ihr Auto gefahren nach Leipzig.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Ich bin ihr Auto nach Leipzig gefahren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Ich habe ihr Auto nach Leipzig gefahrt.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fahren에 4격 목적어(ihr Auto)가 있으면 haben이에요.<br>fahren은 불규칙이라서 gefahren, 과거분사는 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6e5a68ab3c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Hast&quot;],[&quot;gewusst&quot;],[&quot;erfahren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> „<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> du das schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(wissen)</span>?“ – „Nein, das habe ich erst heute <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(erfahren)</span>.“</div><div class=\"qko\">&quot;그거 벌써 알고 있었어요?&quot; – &quot;아니요, 오늘에야 알게 됐어요.&quot;</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · „<b>Hast</b> du das schon <b>gewusst</b>?“ – „Nein, das habe ich erst heute <b>erfahren</b>.“</div>wissen은 혼합 동사 — gewusst.<br>erfahren(알게 되다)은 er- 비분리라서 ge가 없고, fahren처럼 -en으로 끝나요 — erfahren.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6f38706978\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe heute meinen Regenschirm nicht mitgenommen&quot;,&quot;Heute habe ich meinen Regenschirm nicht mitgenommen&quot;,&quot;Meinen Regenschirm habe ich heute nicht mitgenommen&quot;,&quot;Ich habe meinen Regenschirm heute nicht mitgenommen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 오늘 우산을 안 가져갔어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">mitgenommen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">meinen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Regenschirm</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe heute meinen Regenschirm nicht mitgenommen.</b></div>mitnehmen은 분리 + 불규칙 — mit + ge + nommen.<br>nicht는 과거분사 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"36141ca62e\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 보조 동사가 나머지와 다른 동사는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) einschlafen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) werden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) aufwachen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) schlafen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">schlafen은 자는 상태가 계속되는 것이라서 haben이에요.<br>einschlafen·aufwachen·werden은 상태가 바뀌어서 sein이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 틀린 단어를 찾아요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"30ac4e60e1\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe ein Fahrrad gekauft.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> 현재완료로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich kaufe ein Fahrrad.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 31\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe ein Fahrrad gekauft.</b></div>kaufen은 haben과 함께 쓰고, 과거분사는 gekauft예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"15b03864d7\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir sind nach Incheon gefahren.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> 현재완료로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Wir fahren nach Incheon.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 32\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir sind nach Incheon gefahren.</b></div>장소가 바뀌는 동사 fahren은 sein과 함께 써요. 과거분사는 gefahren이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a71065480a\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Er ist um sechs Uhr aufgestanden.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">33.</strong> 현재완료로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Er steht um sechs Uhr auf.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 33\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Er ist um sechs Uhr aufgestanden.</b></div>aufstehen은 상태가 바뀌는 동사라 sein과 써요. 분리동사는 ge-가 접두어와 동사 사이에 들어가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4c4b4c6c96\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"1\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">34.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 베를린으로 비행기를 타고 갔어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Berlin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">geflogen.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Ich bin nach Berlin geflogen.</b></div>fliegen은 장소가 바뀌는 동사라 sein과 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c52b698fc0\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"4\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">35.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 그 경기를 봤어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">haben</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Spiel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">gesieht.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Wir haben das Spiel gesehen.</b></div>sehen은 불규칙 동사예요. 과거분사는 gesehen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"917f905ba0\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"4\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">36.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">소포 받았어?</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Hast</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Paket</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">gebekommen?</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Hast du das Paket bekommen?</b></div>be-로 시작하는 비분리동사는 과거분사에 ge-를 붙이지 않아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"36\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 36</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"